  "content": {
    "en": {
      "name": "Odori Park",
      "description": "Odori Park (大通公園, Ōdōri Kōen) is a park located in the heart of Sapporo, Hokkaido, Japan. Ōdōri (大通) means \"large street\" in Japanese. It stretches east to west through Nishi 1 chōme, Ōdōri to Nishi 12 chōme, Ōdōri (\"Nishi\" means west, and \"chōme\" is a block in Japanese), and divides the city into north and south sections.",
      "highlights": ["Nature"]
    },
    "ja": {
      "name": "大通公園",
      "description": "大通公園（おおどおりこうえん）は、札幌市中央区大通西にある公園。「日本の道100選」「日本の都市公園100選」「都市景観100選」「日本の歴史公園100選」選定。札幌のランドマークである「さっぽろテレビ塔」は大通公園内に位置している。",
      "highlights": ["自然"]
    }
  },
